<h2>Video and audio</h2>

<p>
  <c><video src=… /></c> and <c><audio src=… /></c> take <c>autoplay</c>, <c>loop</c>, <c>muted</c> and <c>controls=false</c>. Audio gives a player bar.
  A video can also be a slide's background: <c>background: clip.mp4</c> in the <c><slide></c> block.
</p>

<video src=clip.webm autoplay loop muted />

<code lang=text>
  <video src=clip.webm autoplay loop muted />
  <audio src=talk.mp3 autoplay />
</code>

<notes>
  autoplay implies muted (browsers block unmuted autoplay). controls=false hides the controls.
</notes>
